# The dupefinder sidecar is a separate .NET service with its own build context
# (dupefinder/Dockerfile). The gate/worker build does `COPY . .`, so without this
# line every Node image build also copies ~850KB of vendored C# it never uses.
dupefinder
# Folders the stack mounts from the checkout when their *_PATH is unset
# (docker-compose.yml). They hold films, not code. On 2026-11-02 the Mac's
# media-downloads-cache was 15 GB: every build copied it in (two minutes for
# COPY . .), and `next build` was killed for memory, which took OrbStack and
# every container down with it. Without it the same build compiled in 5 s.
/media
/media-downloads-cache
/media-excluded
/media-quarantine
/backups
